sequences.description:
Upon casting Resonance Liberation [c=Highlight]Momentary Union[/c], Resonance Liberation [c=Highlight]Remnant Entities[/c] gains the following enhancements:

-[c=Highlight]Remnant Entities[/c] can be performed 2 more time(s);

-Healing multiplier of [c=Highlight]Remnant Entities[/c] is increased by 20%;

-[c=Highlight]Remnant Entities[/c] deals additional [c=Ice]Glacio DMG[/c] equal to 1.20% of Baizhi's Max HP.
